# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
#
# TWO Dockerfiles share this context, and the classic builder has no
# per-Dockerfile ignore file, so this list serves both:
#
#   Dockerfile             the runtime image. Its build stage COPYs a
#                          hand-written list of directories, so what is in the
#                          context beyond that list never reaches it.
#   downstream/Dockerfile  the downstream regression image. It builds the WHOLE
#                          tree and runs `make test`, so the suites (tests/),
#                          the language server (tooling/lsp) and the toolchain
#                          wrapper the Makefile calls (scripts/) must be here.
#
# What stays out is what neither needs: build output, the docs, git metadata.
_build
_opam
dist
.git
docs
**/*.install
**/.DS_Store
